---
import SectionHeader from '~/components/SectionHeader.astro';
import { layers, repoUrl } from '~/data/content';
---

<section id="architecture" class="shell scroll-mt-28 py-24 md:py-32">
  <div data-reveal>
    <SectionHeader
      title="架构"
      standfirst="分层的 Rust 代码库，从度量与文档模型一路走到渲染、命令引擎与可替换的前端。"
    />
  </div>

  <ol
    class="relative mt-16 space-y-10 before:absolute before:bottom-5 before:left-[2rem] before:top-5 before:w-px before:bg-line md:before:left-[2.75rem]"
    data-reveal
  >
    {
      layers.map((layer) => (
        <li class="grid grid-cols-[4rem_1fr] gap-x-4 md:grid-cols-[5.5rem_1fr] md:gap-x-8">
          <div class="flex items-start justify-center pt-1">
            <span class="serif z-10 border-y border-line bg-bg px-2 py-1.5 text-[12.5px] leading-none text-ink-mute">
              {layer.tag}
            </span>
          </div>
          <div>
            <ul class="flex flex-wrap gap-x-5 gap-y-2">
              {layer.crates.map((crate) => (
                <li class="font-mono text-[13px] text-ink">{crate}</li>
              ))}
            </ul>
            <p class="mt-3 max-w-[60ch] text-[15.5px] leading-[1.8] text-ink-soft">{layer.duty}</p>
          </div>
        </li>
      ))
    }
  </ol>

  <div class="mt-16 max-w-[68ch]" data-reveal>
    <div class="grid gap-x-12 gap-y-6 sm:grid-cols-2">
      <p class="text-[15.5px] leading-[1.9] text-ink-soft">
        <code class="font-mono text-[14.5px] text-ink">cargo xtask ci</code>{' '}
        会运行格式化、clippy、约 800 个测试、素材署名检查、分层检查以及 wasm 构建。
      </p>
      <p class="text-[15.5px] leading-[1.9] text-ink-soft">
        贡献者与智能体指南见{' '}
        <a
          href={`${repoUrl}/blob/main/AGENTS.md`}
          class="text-ink underline underline-offset-4 transition-colors hover:text-accent"
          target="_blank"
          rel="noreferrer noopener">AGENTS.md</a
        >。
      </p>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>